  "detail_text": "Draft Solicition –Aberdeen Test Center (ATC) is one of the Department of Defense’s (DoD’s) foremost test and training ranges supporting DoD, non-DoD and commercial material developers by testing a broad spectrum of equipment throughout the life cycle, from concept through deployment. ATC has a need for a highly mobile off-road test course and terrian measurement system. The system will consist of a prime mover and data collection hardware and software. The prime mover will be a rugged off-road capable vehicle. The data collection system will consist of micro-terrain measurement (scanning) instrumentation and an Inertial Navigation System (INS). For more information please see the attached suporting documents or reach out to the POCs below. For this draft solicitation the government asks that industry pay special attention to the evaluation language and submit any requirement or solicitation related questions to the POCs below. These early questions will help to shape the final solicitation and increase ACC's awareness of what industry expects in solicitations.",
  "detail_text_length": 1076,
